Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: Inspector
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Live process inspector for iOS on custom firmware (@FLAVOR@)
 See what your device is actually doing. Every running process, refreshed once a
 second, with its CPU share, memory, thread count and owner. Search by name or
 PID, sort by any column, filter down to system, user or app processes, and
 pause the list to hold a moment still. Open a process for its threads, open
 files and sockets, Mach ports, loaded modules, sandbox status and disk and
 network use, then quit it, force quit it, or export the whole report. The
 `inspector` command answers the same questions from a terminal. Available
 in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, German, French, Spanish and
 Arabic.
